docs {
  Application users with profile, contact details, avatar and account status.

  Any other parameter that names a field filters the results: `gender=female`, `province=Ontario,Quebec` (or the parameter repeated, `province=Ontario&province=Quebec`, which means the same), or ranges with `age[gte]=30&age[lt]=40` (`eq`, `ne`, `gt`, `gte`, `lt`, `lte`).
}
